# cabin_moon_4: the moon at the full moon (4 eighths of its month), lit whole
# (lead call 54). Plain lamp light (24), so it stays bright at night, with
# no mark inside it (at phone size a mark reads as a face).
# Drawn for the phone's wide pixels: 6 columns by 10 rows, rounded, so it
# reads round. The anchor, 0,0, is at_moon, just right of and below the
# disc's middle.
C 24  L -1,-5 0,-5  L -2,-4 1,-4  L -3,-3 2,-3  L -3,-2 2,-2  L -3,-1 2,-1  L -3,0 2,0
      L -3,1 2,1  L -3,2 2,2  L -2,3 1,3  L -1,4 0,4
